This repository bundles third-party code in the RL_CFR_MONOPOLYMODIFIED/ directory.

That code is from "Monopoly Deal Research Platform",
https://github.com/cavaunpeu/monopoly-deal-ai

Copyright 2025 Will Wolf

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (as modified by the copyright
holder). The full text of the license, as distributed by the copyright
holder, is included at RL_CFR_MONOPOLYMODIFIED/LICENSE.

The only modifications made to this code in this repository are:
  - Rewriting import paths:
      game.    -> RL_CFR_MONOPOLYMODIFIED.game.
      models.  -> RL_CFR_MONOPOLYMODIFIED.RL_models_1_CounterfactualRegretMinimization.
  - One locally added file with no upstream counterpart:
      RL_models_1_CounterfactualRegretMinimization/cfr/classic_cfr.py

The bundled code implements Monopoly Deal, a two-player card game. It is
unrelated to, and out of scope for, the board-Monopoly work in
monopoly_game_engine/ (ruleset ppo-plus-v2) elsewhere in this repository.

